{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfad Choose Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runner:</strong> Blend into the environment, build your escape, and survive the timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catcher:</strong> Hunt down all Runners before time\u2019s up. Watch as structures decay and the map reveals their secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spectator:</strong> Sit back and enjoy the chaos, or study others while you wait for your next round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude84 Transform into Props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blend into your surroundings by transforming into almost any object. Outwit your enemies with perfect disguises and unexpected movements.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf1 Build to Outsmart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place walls, stairs, and clever structures to reach new spots or block your pursuers. Fast-paced and temporary \u2014 build smart, build quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Power Orbs \u2013 Turn the Tide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special orbs across the map to gain temporary abilities. Stun enemies, teleport, reveal hidden players, or sabotage builds \u2014 the chaos is yours to control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfad Express Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock fun cosmetics, costumes, emotes, and effects from the in-game store. Personalize your character to stand out or blend in \u2014 your style, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore and Hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/gifmaps.gif?t=1749027472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map is filled with unique hiding spots, tricky terrain, and secrets. Whether you're running or chasing, map knowledge is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2b50 Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide &amp; Seek Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Multiplayer chaos where players become props or hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Building</strong> \u2013 Use simple structures to change the flow of every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power orbs keep matches unpredictable and wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Style your character with unlockable outfits, effects, and emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Maps</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and strategic hiding spots in handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayable Fun</strong> \u2013 No match is ever the same, thanks to player creativity and dynamic tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supports 5\u201315 Players</strong> \u2013 Ideal for parties, streams, or competitive hide-and-seek lovers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1749027472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1749027472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/fe3d39e0d868333b0d56098654afc4c2d02b4b51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749027472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/fe3d39e0d868333b0d56098654afc4c2d02b4b51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749027472","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfad Choose Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragra